{
  "sticker": "bottle",
  "called": "the bottle",
  "skeleton": "a straight glass bottle lying on its side, tilted with its neck up to the right: root under the middle of its underside; body at its centre carries the empty glass; the rolled note inside on its own bone (it slides a little along the bottle when it tips); the cork on a bone at the neck's lip, drawn behind the glass so the lip covers its plug.",
